{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20264xWy0sCPfw1793327773.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>節目《夫妻肺片2》於29日隆重舉行開鏡拜神儀式。當日出席儀式的藝人陣容鼎盛，包括主持單立文、胡蓓蔚、胡諾言、賴慰玲，以及星級嘉賓林盛斌、楊明、莊思明及蔣家旻。</p><p></p><p>《夫妻肺片2》期望能承接第一季的好口碑與美譽，在全新一季中，每集將邀請不同星級嘉賓，一同拆解夫妻間的日常炸彈，大方暢談婚姻生活的點滴，輔助觀眾在婚姻中繼續走向恩愛之路</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"ddab1981-c20c-4afc-94d4-bea3699d1ad0.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20266xWQftHSrP1793327772.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:21:48.705338+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:00:01.611647+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:18:16.850583+00:00","content_hash":"bb39bd9373cd58ee15d8acff752b40ad1f5e43d2523e9accbde18475e5eb3477","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}